DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nZumba\nSynopsis\n:\nZumba with Charlotte and Gelek Yo
	ur Stress Away\nDo you prefer to have fun and music while you exercise? Wh
	at better way to have a cardiovascular workout to the swing of great tunes
	 and great company. Join this Zumba workout to enjoy and experience basic 
	Zumba routines. Exercise doesn’t need to be dull or a physical torture t
	hat you dread! Fun and fitness can go hand in hand!\nSpeaker\n:\nCharlotte
	 Marie\nAudrey Wai Lan KOH\nModerator\n:\nJesslyn Su Ching CHOW\nJoining I
	nstructions\n(In-Person)\n:\nDBS Asia East/Asia West Auditorium (#03-00 Ma
	rina Bay Financial Centre Tower 3\, Singapore  018983\, Singapore)\n \n \n
	 \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230721T165000
